      "message": "Hope my following observations are correct !\n\nI think USB MUX task is made one task for all the ports. In this case it won\u0027t work in case of ack_required cases. Any reason it is not made per port basis as similar to pd task per port ?\n\nFor example port 0 case ack_required is set to TRUE.\nack_task[0] \u003d TASK_ID_INVALID, \nnow usb mux task will be in wait state. port 1 and port 2 is not configured until ack comes from AP for port 0. issue: delay in configuring the other ports\n\nSecond problem is: \n  port 2 case ack is set true. port 1 ack invokes the usb mux task. \n   issue: same mux mode won\u0027t be configured to retimer and virtual mux",
